# This example runs entirely on local durable state and needs no credentials.
#
# The Workflow SDK writes run history to ./.workflow-data and Mastra writes
# run snapshots to ./mastra.db, so `npm run dev` works with an empty .env.
#
# Set these when deploying: on serverless, a file-backed database gives every
# invocation its own empty copy, and resuming a run needs the snapshot written
# when it started.
# DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-database.turso.io
# DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN=
#
# Uncomment if you extend the example with an agent step that calls a model:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
